}
Start: "Start here · K320 proposal has k321 findings\nK323 replacement + whole review → reviewed k269 plan\nRequired checker / startup controls precede Task" {class: start}
Role: "Fresh direct human appointment before Task\nForeground supervisor / checker / child coexist\nPure same-image + ELIGIBLE still lacks authority"
Task: "Checker launches retained Task / script / package CLI\nSame export-only parser · fresh role / release channel\nNo task-owned checker or LIVE fallback"
Admission: "Pinned verifier result + coordinator validation\nImmutable issuance profile ≠ accepted current profile / bridge\nChecker-owned fresh parent / inner domain channels"
Authority: "Proposed separate KoineReferenceEvidence lifecycle\nFresh export → consume.intent → spent.receipt → original start\nNo cleanup refund; qualified receipt / register required"
Gate: "Always-present native contact gate\nPreviously validated domain · LIVE refuses scratch maps\nOpaque startup / rights / maps / proxies: accepted unknown"
Source: "Fixed source adapter\nmdfind -0 · exact predicate · raw stdout / stderr\nSlot ordinals + actual terminal / reap"
Held: "Unbuilt held acquisition adapter\nExact T1–T7 / finite Library versions / Preboot forms\nTwo exact Safari root entries: held A1 equality / immediate re-entry\nRefusal before lookup; fixed files / direct locales"
Objects: "Original evidence objects\nComplete bytes or exact failed prefixes\nEvery source / copy / file / alias occurrence retained"
Decoder: "In-process Core Foundation decoder\nFormat / error + complete type-ID walk\nUTF-16 / data / exact number and date observations"
Envelope: "Closed proposed envelope version 1\nTrees / candidates / flags / tables / LocProvenance\nJoint tails + item-by-item closure + frozen tools"
Oracle: "Separately frozen independent expectations\nFormat-derived / CF-corroborated / regression-only\nRequired inventory + intended negative coordinates"
Observer: "Independent C1–C8 inventory + B1–B8 evidence\nRequired known identities / controls still block\nFull proxy / right / map coverage: accepted unknown"
Verifier: "Independent offline verifier\nRecompute every coordinate; totals are not the oracle\nOriginal hashes cannot qualify generated rewrites"
Boundary: "Complete design → whole review → k269\nClosed blockers / grammars / H/R exceptions + E default\nActual Q / P originals absent; pass / native verdict pending"
Compare: "Independent Reference Admission Check\nIndependent original entry / engine / bounded display\nFull bytes + members / required-result audit / eligible basis\nCP01 ready mechanics; later full-byte continuity first"
